">The single unified structure of Dasein's Being</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"710\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Why the hammer matters at all —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">care makes equipment show up as ready-to-hand</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sets up temporality in the next lesson</text></svg>",
