          "explanation": "\"Medium\" is doing precise philosophical work here: it means the lived body isn't just one more thing we perceive within a pre-existing world, but the very condition through which any world can show up for us as navigable and meaningful. Without that bodily orientation, there is no coherent sense in which a world appears at all.",
