"middle\">Rigorous method for lived experience,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">active clinical and artistic legacy —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"580\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">alongside political catastrophe,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">rigor gaps, and blind spots</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">This is what taking history seriously requires</text></svg>",
